@startuml
title Forgot Password Sequence (/api/auth/forgot-password)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Guest
boundary "ForgotPasswordScreen UI" as ForgotPasswordScreen
entity "ForgotPasswordRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as ForgotPasswordRequestDto
entity "OtpSendResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as ForgotPasswordResponseDto
control "AuthController" as AuthController
control "IAuthService" as IAuthService
control "AuthService" as AuthService
control "ISmsSender" as ISmsSender
entity "User" as UserEntity
entity "UserAuth" as UserAuthEntity
entity "OtpVerification" as OtpEntity
control "IAuthAccountRepository" as IAuthAccountRepository
control "AuthAccountRepository" as AuthAccountRepository
control "IOtpRepository" as IOtpRepository
control "OtpRepository" as OtpRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over ForgotPasswordScreen, MySQL
ForgotPasswordRequest and OtpSendResponse exist in API Contracts.
Interfaces used in code: IAuthService, ISmsSender, IAuthAccountRepository,
  IOtpRepository.
end note
Guest -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Access forgot password page
Guest -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Enter phone number
Guest -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Click Send OTP button
ForgotPasswordScreen -> ForgotPasswordScreen: Validate input
alt Data input invalid
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Data input valid
ForgotPasswordScreen -> ForgotPasswordRequestDto: Create request data(phone)
ForgotPasswordScreen -> AuthController: POST /api/auth/forgot-passwordForgotPasswordRequest
AuthController -> AuthController: Validate ForgotPasswordRequest
alt Request validation fails
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 400 error
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else Request validation success
AuthController -> IAuthService: ForgotPasswordAsync(phone)
IAuthService -> AuthService: ForgotPasswordAsync(phone)
AuthService -> IAuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
IAuthAccountRepository -> AuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query user by phone
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user account
MySQL --> DbContext: User row or null
DbContext -> UserEntity: Materialize User?
DbContext -> UserAuthEntity: Materialize UserAuth?
UserEntity --> DbContext: User or null
UserAuthEntity --> DbContext: UserAuth or null
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: AuthAccount or null
alt User not found or deleted
AuthService --> AuthController: NotFound result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 404 User not found
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else User exists
AuthService -> ISmsSender: SendOtpAsync(phone, "reset")
AuthService -> IOtpRepository: FindLatestAsync(phone, "reset", userId=null, since)
IOtpRepository -> OtpRepository: FindLatestAsync(phone, "reset", userId=null, since)
OtpRepository -> DbContext: Query latest reset OTP
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT latest OTP
MySQL --> DbContext: OTP row or null
DbContext -> OtpEntity: Materialize OtpVerification?
OtpEntity --> DbContext: OtpVerification or null
DbContext --> OtpRepository: Result
OtpRepository --> AuthService: OtpRecord or null
alt OTP request is rate limited
AuthService --> AuthController: TooManyRequests result
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 429 error
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Show error message
else OTP can be sent
AuthService -> IAuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
IAuthAccountRepository -> AuthAccountRepository: FindByPhoneAsync(phone)
AuthAccountRepository -> DbContext: Query reset user by phone
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user account
MySQL --> DbContext: User row
DbContext --> AuthAccountRepository: Result
AuthAccountRepository --> AuthService: AuthAccount
AuthService -> IAuthService: Generate OTP code
IAuthService -> AuthService: Generate OTP code
AuthService -> IOtpRepository: StageCreateAsync(CreateOtpRecord)
IOtpRepository -> OtpRepository: StageCreateAsync(CreateOtpRecord)
OtpRepository -> OtpEntity: Create OtpVerification
OtpEntity --> OtpRepository: OtpVerification
OtpRepository -> DbContext: Add OtpVerification
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT otp_verifications
MySQL --> DbContext: Insert result
DbContext --> OtpRepository: Save result
OtpRepository --> AuthService: OTP saved
AuthService -> ISmsSender: SendOtpAsync(phone, otpCode)
AuthService --> AuthController: Return OTP send result
AuthController -> ForgotPasswordResponseDto: Create response data(expires_in)
AuthController --> ForgotPasswordScreen: HTTP 200 OK\nOtpSendResponse
ForgotPasswordScreen --> Guest: Navigate to reset OTP page
end
end
end
end
@enduml
